sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Musician
    participant UI as WebClient
    participant API as SignupController
    participant SS as SignupService
    participant MR as MusicianRepository
    participant EVR as EventRepository
    participant SR as SignupRepository
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant BR as BandRepository
    participant NR as NotificationRepository
    participant ES as EmailService

    Note over M,ES: Scenario 3 - Musician signs up for an Event (UC-MUS-001 main success scenario)
    Note over M,ES: Given Musician 1 exists and Event 1 exists (UC-MUS-005 View Event Details was done before)

    activate M
    M->>UI: clickSignUp(eventId=1, info=Available)
    activate UI
    UI->>API: POST /api/events/1/signups (info=Available)
    activate API
    API->>API: resolveMusicianId(sessionToken)
    API->>SS: createSignup(musicianId=1, eventId=1, info=Available)
    activate SS

    SS->>MR: findById(1)
    activate MR
    MR-->>SS: Musician(id=1)
    deactivate MR

    SS->>EVR: findById(1)
    activate EVR
    EVR-->>SS: Event(id=1, band_id=3, capacity=5, date)
    deactivate EVR

    SS->>SR: existsByMusicianIdAndEventId(1, 1)
    activate SR
    SR-->>SS: false
    deactivate SR

    SS->>SR: countByEventId(1)
    activate SR
    SR-->>SS: currentCount=3
    deactivate SR
    SS->>SS: assertBelowCapacity(3, 5)

    alt all guards passed (Musician found, Event found, no duplicate, below Event.capacity)
        opt info is not blank (UC-MUS-009 Write Signup Note)
            SS->>SS: validateInfo(info)
        end
        Note over SS,SR: When Musician 1 signs up for Event 1 with info Available
        SS->>SR: insert(Signup(musician_id=1, event_id=1, info=Available))
        activate SR
        SR-->>SS: Signup(id=17)
        deactivate SR

        Note over SS,ES: UC-SYS-003 Send Notification (included by UC-MUS-001)
        SS->>NS: notifyBand(signupId=17, bandId=3)
        activate NS
        NS->>BR: findById(3)
        activate BR
        BR-->>NS: Band(id=3, email)
        deactivate BR
        activate NR
        par email channel
            NS->>ES: sendEmail(band.email, New signup for Event 1)
            activate ES
            ES-->>NS: accepted(messageId)
            deactivate ES
            NS->>NR: insert(Notification(signup_id=17, channel=email, status=sent))
            NR-->>NS: Notification(id=41)
        and on-site channel
            NS->>NR: insert(Notification(signup_id=17, channel=site, status=unread))
            NR-->>NS: Notification(id=42)
        end
        deactivate NR
        NS-->>SS: Notified
        deactivate NS

        SS-->>API: SignupCreated(signupId=17)
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>M: showConfirmation()
        Note over M,ES: Then a Signup is created, the Band is notified by email and a site Notification is recorded
    else a guard failed (see scenarios 4 and 11)
        SS-->>API: SignupRejected(reasonCode)
        API-->>UI: 404 Not Found or 409 Conflict
        UI-->>M: showError(reasonCode)
    end

    deactivate SS
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI
    deactivate M
